to make odin's son kozuki

267
00:22:53,540 --> 00:22:56,720
momonosuke the shogun
of the land of wano No,

268
00:22:57,180 --> 00:23:02,220
all gifters in Tobiropo who are not
locked in combat, you have a new mission.

269
00:23:04,100 --> 00:23:07,394
Kozuki Momonosuke is currently
in the right brain tower.

270
00:23:07,860 --> 00:23:10,280
Find him and bring his head to me.

271
00:23:11,280 --> 00:23:13,986
That'll take all the
fight out of the samurai.

272
00:23:16,900 --> 00:23:19,800
As for the pirates, that's another matter.

273
00:23:20,380 --> 00:23:23,556
Don't worry, we'll deal with
them when the time comes.

274
00:23:33,100 --> 00:23:36,540
He told us to kill him
instead of catching him alive.

275
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,220
This should be easy.

276
00:23:44,260 --> 00:23:45,480
Now fire!

277
00:24:04,460 --> 00:24:05,290
Go!

278
00:24:05,460 --> 00:24:07,200
Collect the corpse! Yes, sir!

279
00:24:08,700 --> 00:24:10,160
I should be here.

280
00:24:10,580 --> 00:24:12,540
Wait, what's that?

281
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:14,960
Uh, the barrel?

282
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,300
Huh? Huh?

283
00:24:26,620 --> 00:24:27,980
Just a knife?

284
00:24:28,120 --> 00:24:29,826
Against the Armored Division?

285
00:24:29,960 --> 00:24:31,400
Don't make me laugh!

286
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:40,150
Shirabu!

287
00:24:40,233 --> 00:24:41,063
I'll be fine.

288
00:24:41,220 --> 00:24:42,455
Stay hidden, my lord.

289
00:24:44,460 --> 00:24:46,100
You're brave, at least.

290
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:51,400
But as their name implies, everyone
on my team has armored bodies.

291
00:24:52,040 --> 00:24:53,540
You're out of options.

292
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:56,080
Aim for the brat!

293
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:04,460
I'll protect you!

294
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:16,317
Please, run away...

295
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:18,660
Shinobu?

296
00:25:20,540 --> 00:25:22,360
I'll kill you both!

297
00:25:22,860 --> 00:25:25,017
Right here, right now!

298
00:25:25,100 --> 00:25:28,120
That tiny weapon won't be enough!

299
00:25:30,660 --> 00:25:31,720
Tino, no!

300
00:25:39,260 --> 00:25:42,140
Please run away, Lord Momonosuke!

301
00:25:43,740 --> 00:25:44,570
Run away?

302
00:25:44,653 --> 00:25:45,660
Is that right?

303
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:48,860
Is that what a Shogun is supposed to do?

304
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,700
Run, Shinobu!

305
00:25:55,920 --> 00:25:56,820
Don't die!

306
00:25:57,300 --> 00:25:58,920
Little rat!

307
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:04,980
Stop it!

308
00:26:07,740 --> 00:26:08,780
No!

309
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:42,620
Well, this is interesting.

310
00:26:43,580 --> 00:26:47,040
You sure you want to butt
in, young master Yamato?

311
00:26:49,140 --> 00:26:50,397
Who's butting in?

312
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:53,840
It's only natural that I would
fight for the Kozuki clan.

313
00:27:03,360 --> 00:27:05,700
I am Odin, after all!

314
00:27:12,140 --> 00:27:14,020
Aim those swords at his throat!

315
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:18,260
No celebrating until we know that
bastard is dead! Right you are!

316
00:27:18,460 --> 00:27:20,960
Time to execute Kaido! Forward!

317
00:27:35,700 --> 00:27:40,660
It was only a shadow, but I sensed the
strength of Kozuki Oden in your attack.

318
00:27:42,700 --> 00:27:45,080
It would have been a fine time to die.

319
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:54,360
My scar aches again, and just like
always, I remember that fateful day.

320
00:27:55,940 --> 00:27:56,770
Mother!

321
00:28:00,700 --> 00:28:01,530
Help me!

322
00:28:01,613 --> 00:28:02,540
Turn around!

323
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:04,140
He's hurting me!

324
00:28:22,960 --> 00:28:28,280
If she hadn't meddled in that single
moment, that might have been the end.

325
00:28:29,260 --> 00:28:34,320
But even with your strength
combined, you're still no Odin.

326
00:28:51,560 --> 00:28:52,877


327
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:57,320
But you won't reopen my scar
with such shallow attacks.

328
00:28:59,040 --> 00:29:01,880
There's no hope for you.

329
00:29:18,180 --> 00:29:20,300
A storm of slashes!

330
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:23,790
Ha!

331
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:41,790
Kiku!
